<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The long, long night is past, the morning breaks at last;</l><l>And hushed the dreadful wail and fury of the blast,</l><l>As o’er the golden hills the day advances fast!</l><l>The Comforter has come!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lo, the great King of kings, with healing in His wings,</l><l>To every captive soul a full deliv’rance brings;</l><l>And through the vacant cells the song of triumph rings:</l><l>The Comforter has come!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O boundless love divine! how shall this tongue of mine</l><l>To wond’ring mortals tell the matchless grace divine—</l><l>That I, a child of hell, should in His image shine!</l><l>The Comforter has come!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
